      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example 2.A",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p>Two parallel lines are cut by a transversal. One interior angle is \\( 72^{\\circ} \\). Find its alternate interior angle.</p><p>Alternate interior angles are equal:</p>\\[ 72^{\\circ}. \\]",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example 2.B",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p>A co-interior angle measures \\( 110^{\\circ} \\). Find the other co-interior angle.</p>\\[ 180^{\\circ}-110^{\\circ}=70^{\\circ}. \\]",
          "ar": null
        }
      }
